{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A cozy, nostalgic puzzle game about projected dreams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into the room, drag toys from the shelves, and handle them on the table to create a shadow play. As the shadows you cast uncover past family relationships and the environment around you changes and evolves, the lines between reality and fantasy blur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/divider.png?t=1744382698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Projected Dreams is a charming, cozy puzzle game emphasising a casual, stress-free gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/PD_Story_new.png?t=1744382698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/divider.png?t=1744382698\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience a heartfelt story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Senka on her journey and experience a heartwarming, wordless story about buzzing summer nights, the importance of friendship, and bittersweet goodbyes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/Photo-Gifs.gif?t=1744382698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/divider.png?t=1744382698\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve puzzles in multiple ways</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate, place, and stack objects on a table to recreate a given shadow silhouette on the wall through shadow play. Get creative \u2013 there are unlimited solutions to solve puzzles, as long the outline of the shadow matches, and various achievements to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/Building-Gifs.gif?t=1744382698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/divider.png?t=1744382698\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore atmospheric settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an ever-changing room and bring back memories from your own childhood thanks to the toys you will find. Discover new peculiarities while listening to relaxing soundtracks composed by Floris Demandt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/Setting-Gif.gif?t=1744382698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/extras/divider.png?t=1744382698\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2318800?t=1744382698","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744382698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/c3507f6f9c4c7e57e8ffad80ade8c7f34ff10362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744382698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2318800/c3507f6f9c4c7e57e8ffad80ade8c7f34ff10362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744382698","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2482860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A cozy, nostalgic puzzle game about projected 